    "Both installed-package authenticated routes accept unchanged speculation, reject dependency changes spanning analysis, and allow a fresh retry on the same service.",
    "Explicit regular-file and directory watches do not discover paths or recursively add watches in response to events.",
    "Sixteen write-and-restore rounds through an outside-root hard link retain bytes and modification time while producing vnode events; writes to an existing unrelated file do not invalidate the observation.",
